{"appid": 2356780, "gama": {"steamId": 2356780, "id": 2356780, "name": "Dungeon Clawler", "copiesSold": 385291, "unreleased": false, "earlyAccess": false, "firstReleaseDate": 1732147200000, "releaseDate": 1777561234000, "earlyAccessExitDate": 1777561234000, "EAReleaseDate": 1732147200000, "price": 14.99, "developers": ["Stray Fawn Studio"], "publishers": ["Stray Fawn Publishing"], "publisherClass": "Indie", "reviewScore": 89, "genres": ["Action", "Casual", "RPG", "Simulation", "Strategy"], "tags": ["Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Replay Value", "Arcade", "Strategy", "Roguelite", "Gambling", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Singleplayer", "Physics", "Roguelike", "2D", "Deckbuilding", "Cute", "Casual", "RPG", "Retro", "Turn-Based Combat", "Dungeon Crawler", "Procedural Generation", "Action"]}, "store": {"type": "game", "name": "抓抓地牢", "steam_appid": 2356780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3299430, 4580480], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《抓抓地牢》将卡牌构建与肉鸽元素相结合，最重要的是：还有抓娃娃机。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/extras/d89123c47f9ebc0e901cf44c37e4eff5.poster.avif?t=1791808655\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/extras/d89123c47f9ebc0e901cf44c37e4eff5.webm?t=1791808655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/extras/d89123c47f9ebc0e901cf44c37e4eff5.mp4?t=1791808655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在抓娃娃机中找到新道具并将它们添加进你的卡组，以创造改变游戏的套路。赚取金币来升级或修改你的道具，并解锁新的未知协同效应。你需要用尽所有手段来到达地牢中心邪恶地牢领主的巢穴，并夺回你失去的爪子。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/extras/1863fbc8d3cd94f18b618a531b799ba9.poster.avif?t=1791808655\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/extras/1863fbc8d3cd94f18b618a531b799ba9.webm?t=1791808655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/extras/1863fbc8d3cd94f18b618a531b799ba9.mp4?t=1791808655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 终极的抓娃娃机肉鸽体验。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >独特的角色，每个角色都有不同的优势和弱点。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >多个难度级别和可解锁的幸运爪，定制你的游戏进程。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >打破游戏规则——用不同的爪子和物品协同效应疯狂游戏。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/extras/4d55d5e350b848c1b1bc0b8416ebe7a5.poster.avif?t=1791808655\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/extras/4d55d5e350b848c1b1bc0b8416ebe7a5.webm?t=1791808655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/extras/4d55d5e350b848c1b1bc0b8416ebe7a5.mp4?t=1791808655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >冒险进入神秘地点，发现宝藏以及奇怪和危险的障碍。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在地牢的弹球机上花费你辛苦赚来的硬币。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在你旅程中遇见并帮助不同其他的有趣角色。</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《抓抓地牢》将卡牌构建与肉鸽元素相结合，最重要的是：还有抓娃娃机。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/extras/d89123c47f9ebc0e901cf44c37e4eff5.poster.avif?t=1791808655\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/extras/d89123c47f9ebc0e901cf44c37e4eff5.webm?t=1791808655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/extras/d89123c47f9ebc0e901cf44c37e4eff5.mp4?t=1791808655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在抓娃娃机中找到新道具并将它们添加进你的卡组，以创造改变游戏的套路。赚取金币来升级或修改你的道具，并解锁新的未知协同效应。你需要用尽所有手段来到达地牢中心邪恶地牢领主的巢穴，并夺回你失去的爪子。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/extras/1863fbc8d3cd94f18b618a531b799ba9.poster.avif?t=1791808655\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/extras/1863fbc8d3cd94f18b618a531b799ba9.webm?t=1791808655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/extras/1863fbc8d3cd94f18b618a531b799ba9.mp4?t=1791808655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 终极的抓娃娃机肉鸽体验。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >独特的角色，每个角色都有不同的优势和弱点。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >多个难度级别和可解锁的幸运爪，定制你的游戏进程。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >打破游戏规则——用不同的爪子和物品协同效应疯狂游戏。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/extras/4d55d5e350b848c1b1bc0b8416ebe7a5.poster.avif?t=1791808655\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/extras/4d55d5e350b848c1b1bc0b8416ebe7a5.webm?t=1791808655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/extras/4d55d5e350b848c1b1bc0b8416ebe7a5.mp4?t=1791808655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >冒险进入神秘地点，发现宝藏以及奇怪和危险的障碍。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在地牢的弹球机上花费你辛苦赚来的硬币。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在你旅程中遇见并帮助不同其他的有趣角色。</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "《抓抓地牢》是一款结合了娃娃机玩法的Roguelike卡牌构筑游戏。构建你的卡组，从抓娃娃机中抓取武器和道具！与敌人激战，搭配强大的增益效果，创造出改变战局的组合，并在地牢探险中释放疯狂的连招吧！", "supported_languages": "英语<strong>*</strong>, 法语, 德语, 西班牙语 - 西班牙, 日语, 韩语, 波兰语, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西, 俄语, 简体中文, 土耳其语, 意大利语<br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/header_schinese.jpg?t=1791808655", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/d089998300edb92079a04347be34b07cd6116749/capsule_231x87_schinese.jpg?t=1791808655", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/d089998300edb92079a04347be34b07cd6116749/capsule_184x69_schinese.jpg?t=1791808655", "website": "https://strayfawnstudio.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统 *:</strong> Windows® 7, Windows® 10<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Quad Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> GeForce GTX 660, Radeon RX 460 or similar dedicated graphics card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 2 GB 可用空间</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> macOS 10.13 or newer<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Quad Co